1
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,680
Who fired that arrow?

2
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:38,080
Could there be others who want Zhu Huaichen dead?

3
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,920
Perhaps he can be of use to me

4
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,000
Who's there?

5
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,360
My lord, is that you?

6
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,480
Catch the assassin!

7
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:02,720
I remember this guy being sickly

8
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,960
Could he have been faking it all along?

9
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:08,800
Hiding his martial arts skills to kill Zhu Huaichen?

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:15,440
That consumptive wretch

11
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,960
People are born with different constitutions

12
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,920
Not to mention different life experiences

13
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,120
Given the choice

14
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,320
Everyone would prefer health and safety

15
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,360
Don't you agree, Third Prince?

16
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:24,440
Don't you agree, Third Prince?

17
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:33,800
Catch the assassin!

18
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,560
Search every single one of them

19
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,880
Search them all! Yes sir!

20
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:47,360
Well?

21
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,200
Nothing, nothing found

22
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,200
Why are you wearing wedding attire?

23
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,120
How dare you!

24
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,280
You scoundrel! How could you...

25
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,840
My apologies

26
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:47,440
That madwoman dared to blind me

27
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,960
I'll have her executed immediately

28
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,640
Don't be angry, Chen Lang

29
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,120
Killing her now

30
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,440
would be letting her off too easy

31
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:57,480
We haven't settled the score from the martial arts tournament yet

32
00:02:57,880 --> 00:03:00,080
She made you lose face

33
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,160
before His Majesty and all the princes

34
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,160
We should keep her alive

35
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,720
and torture her slowly

36
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,520
Besides, we still need her to find the Dragon Jade

37
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:30,600
Death would be too merciful for her

38
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,760
I want her to wish she were dead

39
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,320
Exactly, Chen Lang

40
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,600
And as you've said before, Chen Lang

41
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:41,840
Li Zhi'an and the old Li family troops haven't surrendered yet

42
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,880
If we can gain control of their former military forces

43
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:47,720
It will greatly aid your ambitious conquest

44
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:54,360
The dragon jade contains a treasure map left by the Li family ancestors

45
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,600
Rumored to rival all the wealth in the world

46
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:59,000
Only by obtaining the dragon jade treasure

47
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,720
Can one truly unify the realm

48
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,000
It seems they're searching for the dragon jade

49
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,800
Third Prince

50
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,760
Have you found it?

51
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:23,240
Reporting Your Highness, nothing in the house

52
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,440
Dismissed

53
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,240
Yes

54
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,520
Huaichen, is that you?

55
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,400
Zhi'an

56
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:36,960
It's me

57
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,440
Yesterday I accidentally injured my husband

58
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,080
How are your injuries now?

59
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,000
I'm perfectly fine

60
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,760
No need to worry

61
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,000
Attendants!

62
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,640
The princess consort has awakened

63
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,800
Prepare to depart once ready

64
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,760
Husband, you're hurting me

65
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:58,680
You must be angry with me, aren't you?

66
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,520
Not at all

67
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:04,400
By the way, Zhian, it's a long journey ahead

68
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:07,280
The important item your father-in-law gave you

69
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,280
Make sure to keep it safe

70
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:11,960
You have eye problems

71
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:12,760
If it's inconvenient

72
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,800
You can entrust it to me

73
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:18,160
Trying to trick me into handing over the Dragon Jade

74
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:22,160
Too bad you don't even know what Dragon Jade is

75
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,880
If that bitch hadn't betrayed me in my past life

76
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:29,560
Even I wouldn't have known about it

77
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,320
Important things

78
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,200
I just remembered

79
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:35,240
Father once said

80
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:37,400
His most precious possession was me

81
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,920
Now that I'm your wife

82
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,000
As long as you protect me well

83
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,840
Won't you be holding the most important treasure?

84
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,640
You

85
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,240
Imperial Brother

86
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,560
The Li family army has come to see off Your Highness and Lady Li

87
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,200
Let's not keep them waiting

88
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,440
I will never let you have your way

89
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,840
We've searched the entire general's residence

90
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,440
But found no trace of the Dragon Jade

91
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:18,160
Useless fools

92
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:18,880
Get out

93
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:19,640
Yes

94
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:28,560
Imperial Brother, news has spread about how the Northern Jin royal family slaughtered General Li's entire household

95
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,680
Taking advantage of the drunken wedding banquet

96
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:32,280
In their attempt to seize the Dragon Jade

97
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:35,160
Now all the former northern division generals are waiting outside

98
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:39,440
They demand to witness Li Zhi'an's departure from Northern Jin with their own eyes

99
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:42,760
These old Li family loyalists are hard to deceive

100
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:47,200
Imperial Brother can tolerate their insolence for a few more days

101
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,400
Once we reach Nanliang territory

102
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,440
After gaining the trust of those troops

103
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:54,280
We'll eliminate those generals one by one

104
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:58,440
Then we won't have to worry about these forces not submitting to you

105
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:01,960
Is this plan of yours reliable?

106
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,120
I've already played the pitiful orphan

107
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,480
too fragile to endure more suffering

108
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:09,560
persuaded the generals to conceal the massacre of the Li family

109
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:10,920
from Miss Li

110
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:15,560
Moreover, the Emperor lost an eye for Miss Li's sake

111
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:18,240
They certainly won't suspect anything now

112
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,400
Zhi'an

113
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,120
Your parents couldn't bear the separation

114
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,680
so I didn't let them come to see us off

115
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:37,800
Huai Chen

116
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:41,320
Let me bow here to bid farewell to my parents

117
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:13,240
Now the only way is to produce the Li family's military token

118
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:16,280
to alert the uncles that something's wrong

119
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,560
and stop me from leaving the mansion

120
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:20,320
But Zhu Huaichen might have anticipated this

121
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,640
Today marks the young mistress's wedding

122
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:25,920
We, the remaining Li family troops, respectfully send off our young mistress

123
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,880
As expected, we can't use the secret token to warn the Li army

124
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,880
Ambushes are everywhere

125
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,400
Respected uncles

126
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,160
You've watched Zhi'an grow up

127
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,760
and now you're escorting her to her wedding

128
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,320
One day

129
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:51,480
Zhi'an will repay your kindness

130
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:04,080
Now my Li family has been falsely accused of treason

131
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:07,920
Only by going to Nanliang to expose Zhu Huaichen's conspiracy

132
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:10,040
can I clear my name and take revenge
